Package: rhind
Title: Exact Fractions as Vectors
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Mitchell",
             family = "O'Hara-Wild",
             email = "mail@mitchelloharawild.com",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6729-7695")))
Description: A semantic data type for fractions, storing the numerator and
    denominator separately as whole numbers. Fractions are displayed as they
    were written, while arithmetic, comparison and summaries are exact and give
    results in lowest terms (e.g. 1/3 + 1/6 is 1/2). The components are stored
    as integers or doubles, with integers becoming doubles when results need
    larger numbers.
